  "title": "Slow Cooker Mexican Pork Carnitas",
  "description": "Mexican pork carnitas are cooked in the slow cooker with adobo seasoning, onions, and tomatoes and are perfect to serve in soft tortilla with a fresh and crunchy cabbage slaw.",
